        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A striped htr baby blanket is 75 x 90 cm. Half treble rows in a four-colour rotation build clean horizontal stripes in DK cotton. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "colour-change-crochet"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "colour changes"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " happen at the end of each row."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DK cotton in four colours at 2 rows per stripe gives a narrow candy-stripe look. At 6 rows per colour the stripes are bolder. Total yardage is around 380 g (95 g per colour at equal stripe width)."
          }
        ]
      },
