            "text": "Turning chain"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of ch 2. Work 1 htr into every chain. Turn. (120 htr.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stripe sequence"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work 4 rows each in Colour A, B, C, D, then back to A. Carry each colour up the side edge when not in use (or cut and rejoin if the stripe gap is more than 8 rows). Work until piece measures 90 cm (approximately 108 rows). Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work one round of dc (UK) around the perimeter. Work 3 dc into each corner. Secure all tails with "
